     where ChordWave's engine differs (the correction replaces the manual
     curve rather than sitting under it; preamp is automatic).
     All names are mochy_eq_* — verified collision-free against the
     worktree res/values and staging/phase5-audiolab. Preset names reuse
     the existing eq_preset_* strings; mode names reuse
     equalizer_dynamic/equalizer_manual. -->
